window.products.push({"id":619082,"name":"PurSteam 1400-Watt Steamer for Clothes, Wrinkle Remover, Fast Heat-up, Large Detachable Water Tank, Exact Measure Filler Cup and 2 in 1 Brush Included","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61X4UUQCiPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔎 WHY PURSTEAM HANDHELD GARMENT STEAMERS? - The latest edition of your favorite PurSteam handheld steamer is here. Unique and practical, this steamer is perfect for home, business, travel and easily stored and kept for any purpose. Our Multi-purpose handheld steamer will: steam, iron, clean, refresh, treat & sterilize. We know laundry gets tedious and that is why our steamer is ready to use in seconds! This PurSteam garment steamer will save you time and make your life easier, guaranteed! 🔎 EASY & SAFE - It is portable, powerful, and compact. Our steamer combines impressive 1400-watt power with maximum efficiency to quickly remove all wrinkles almost instantly. The water tank holds up to 4 fl oz/ 130ml of tap water, and our lightweight wide base design prevents the steamer from tipping or spilling hot water. With this travel PurSteam steamer, steaming has never been easier. 🔎 YOUR NEW TRAVEL BUDDY - Carry it with you anywhere you go! No matter if you are staying at a hotel or going on a road trip, this lightweight mini steamer is perfect for any traveler! Its compact size makes it easy to fit in any suitcase, bag or a backpack. You don't have to worry about wrinkled clothes while travelling anymore! Enjoy and let this powerful steamer do all the work for you. 🔎 GENTLE ON ALL FABRICS - Powerful but gentle, this handy steamer is highly effective and 100% safe to use on all fabrics: cotton, silk, wool, polyester, velvet, fiber and all delicate fabrics. It will de-wrinkle and sanitize not only your clothes but curtains & drapery, tablecloths, bedding, upholstery, toys and much more. When the water tank is empty, the steamer will automatically shut off, preventing the unit from overheating. 🔎 SATISFACTION GUARANTEED WITH PURSTEAM - We deeply care for our customers and want only the best for you, so we offer a 2-year warranty! Fast and professional customer service is always there to help you with anything you need! We promise to bring you nothing but the best quality steamer on the market! What are you waiting for? Try it out now and we guarantee you'll love it!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61X4UUQCiPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PurSteam World's Best Steamers","source_asin":"B082MTCFX8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-619082","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082MTCFX8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082MTCFX8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
