window.products.push({"id":619099,"name":"South Dakota Watercolor Map by Naxart Matted Framed Art, 11 by 14-Inch, Black Frame","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":46.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UYnZS4CfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This matted framed art piece features a watercolor map of South Dakota. We are a group of creative professionals with diverse backgrounds in architecture, interior design, art, automotive design, and photography. All of us are passionate about their fields of expertise as well as art and design in general. Instead of a traditional approach of associating art with a specific artist we chose to create a NaxArt brand that represents our values and vision rather than promoting individual agendas. We also work with architects and interior designers looking for unique art work for projects ranging from a small NYC studio design to large scale corporate development projects. We also love our customers that simply discover NaxArt's collection of art and acquire our art to design their own homes. An 8x10 giclee print under acrylic in an 11x14 black frame. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating museum quality fine art reproductions. This high quality print is matted using antique white matting and comes in a black frame. A clear acrylic facing is added to protect the print. The piece is fully assembled by professional framers and comes ready to hang. The antique white mat allows the image to really stand out, making it a great addition to any space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UYnZS4CfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00FLUN5TW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-619099","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00FLUN5TW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00FLUN5TW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
