window.products.push({"id":619120,"name":"Cambom Cheese Grater Citrus Zester Lemon Zester Pack of 3-304 Stainless Steel - A Sharp Tool for Parmesan Cheese, Ginger, Garlic, Nutmeg, Chocolate, V","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZR2mr3HPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧀Cheese Grater Combination Set: Grater with fine, Coarse and Extra coarse holes and a cleaning brush. Each one comes with a protective shell. Super cost performance portfolio. 🧀Meet Your Different Needs: The multi-functional grater helps you complete the pre-cooking preparation for pillow Parmesan, lemon, ginger, garlic, nutmeg, chocolate, cinnamon, vegetables and citrus fruits. It's also a great tool for making nutritious meals for kids, like crushing carrots, potatoes, and more. 🧀Superior Process: Lemon Zester is made of 304 stainless steel, and the blade is photochemically etchable. The blade is uniform, sharp and durable, and does not clog easily. The comfortable TPR handle is a good size and feels good to hold. At the bottom of the planer, there are anti-skid bars, which make the operation more stable. Lifetime rust free, dishwasher safe. 🧀Convenient Storage: The Fine blade is 11.8×1.45 in. Coarse and Extra Coarse are 11.4×2.4 in. Exquisite proportions, very comfortable to operate. There are mounting holes at the top for easy hanging. 🧀After-sales Service: All products purchased by Cambom, all can enjoy quality protection for 90 days, if you have any question including product quality problems, use problem, even if your return window has closed, also please don't worry about it, please contact the business customer service in your order, can email or contact seller button to connect with us. 24 hours customer service reception, all messages within 1 hour reply.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZR2mr3HPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cambom","source_asin":"B08C29J3W8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-619120","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08C29J3W8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08C29J3W8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
