window.products.push({"id":619145,"name":"Manual Can Opener with Corkscrew and Bottle Opener Perfect for Camping, Traveling and Everyday Use(Pack Of 2) - By RamPro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FLqix2hTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"RamPro Can Opener with Corkscrew The Problem: You need to open a can in your kitchen but you do not have the required tool for doing the same. This creates a lot of difficulty in opening the can and your work is stalled. You have gone out for camping with your friends where you spend a great evening partying with all your friends. You have two bottles of champagne with you but unfortunately you do not have the appropriate tool to open the bottles thereby spoiling the mood of the party. Our Solution: Our handy can opener is just the perfect thing which you need for the purpose of opening the can you need in your kitchen. Now, when you have the good quality can opener with you, the cans can be very easily and conveniently opened without any kinds of interruptions.  Our can opener with corkscrew is just the ideal thing you need when you have gone for camping with your friends. The best corkscrew is just perfect to open the champagne bottles and set the mood of the camping party at its best. Quality is Great The can opener and corkscrew is constructed of nickel plated metal for enhanced durability. Our can opener is manufactured in such a way that there is no compromise in the quality of the product. Portable and Easy to Use Our can opener manual is extremely easy to use and long lasting in nature as well. The combination can opener and corkscrew serves dual purpose thereby highly beneficial for the users Easy to Clean and Maintain The can opener and corkscrew is very easy to clean and maintain. The can opener is dishwasher safe which makes it even more convenient to clean as well. Applications are Great The Can Bottle Opener Smooth Edge is used in the kitchen and at a number of other places where there is a need of opening cans or bottles.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FLqix2hTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RamPro","source_asin":"B082XJ9KMR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-619145","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082XJ9KMR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082XJ9KMR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
