window.products.push({"id":619148,"name":"BRASSTAR Resin Statue Pair Elephants 12” Golden Gem Wedding Gift Love Wealth Luck Gather Feng Shui Sculpture Home Office Decor Figurine Business Gift ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612lDwoq6XL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","description":"Product Specifications: - Size: 5.1*2.6*12”.  -Net Weight: 1.96 pound  - Product Material: fine finished resin - An elephant is an auspicious animal in many cultures. This piece of art, featuring  a pair of elephants represent the harmony of Ying and Yang, would bring good fortune to you and your loved one. - Package Content: one pair * brand-new resin statues Product Description: Elephant has been an auspicious symbol since ancient times. It can siphon a great quantity of water, which, in Feng Shui, represents wealth, and so, elephant is considered as being able to absorb and attract wealth. Placing the artifact of elephant in the store or office room, you will have wealth flowing in.  In Chinese, elephant sounds like “auspicious” (xiang) and symbolizes peace and happiness. Placing the artifact of elephant in your home will bring you better fortune, ward off evils and bless your family with peace, health and prosperity.  Moreover, a pair of elephant would be a great gift for newly-weds, it brings good energy of Ying Yang balance to the new family,Elephants represent faithful love, brings good blessing to the home. The sculpture is carefully hand processed by skillful craftsman, it would be a tasteful piece of art adding to your personal space. -Where to place the statue?- For preventing the loss of Chi from the home, place the elephants facing outward. Display the pair of elephants in bedroom promotes love and faithfulness between a couple, this is a common way to use a pair of elephants. Place it in your child’s bedroom, it brings academic success.  We thank you for choosing our product.  If you have any further questions, please contact us. ❤ With blessing ❤","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612lDwoq6XL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BRASSTAR","source_asin":"B098DVFKLQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-619148","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098DVFKLQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098DVFKLQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
