window.products.push({"id":619246,"name":"Coat Hook Rack with 5 Round Hooks - Premium Modern Wall Mounted - Ultra durable with solid steel construction, Brushed stainless steel finish, Super e","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fdbLbdMjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EASY TO INSTALL - Our PREMIUM 5 Round Hook Wall Mounted Hook Rack can be installed within minutes thanks to our high-quality mounting kit that comes included. Our Racks can be mounted on any surface that includes wood, brick, tile and other surfaces. This can also be installed in a bathroom, kitchen, hallway, foyer, office or bedroom. They can be easily mounted on the back of a door. MODERN APPEARANCE - Each PREMIUM Wall Mounted Hook Rack has our Modern design, with solid 304 stainless steel, beautiful round hooks making it the perfect rack for your home, office or industrial environment. Our PREMIUM Hook Rack is brush finished and have hidden mounting plugs. SOLID STAINLESS STEEL - Our goal at QT Home Decor is to ensure our customers have a Modern Look combined with durability and quality. Our Wall Mounted Coat Rack is ideal for unused wall space in any home or office and comes with a 5 solid stainless steel hooks. Nothing compares to solid steel versus cheaper alternatives like zinc or hollow metal. DIMENSIONS - Base width - 1-1/4\" (3 cm), Base Length 13-1/4\" (34 cm). Rack and hooks extend 2\" (5 cm) out from the wall. Perfect length for hanging items such as coats, hats, clothing, robes, umbrellas or towels. Each hook can bear a weight of 22-33 pounds (10-15 KG). USA WARRANTY - 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEED - Customer satisfaction is our highest priority. All of our products are protected by QT Home Decor’s One-Year ‘Worry Free Warranty’. You can reach our customer service Mon-Fri, 9-5PM EST, at (949)342-5229. We love hearing from you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fdbLbdMjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"QT Home Decor","source_asin":"B01G2T84YQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-619246","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01G2T84YQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01G2T84YQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":619247,"name":"Sterling Home Classique Collection 2 Piece Santoku Knife Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/315HD3SHXNL._AC_.jpg","description":"Sterling Home Classique collection offers quality at an affordable price. The santoku is a Japanese cook's (or chef's) knife, featuring a low-tip style with a broad blade. The cutting edge is minimally curved, so it provides less rocking action than a European-style cook's knife. A cross between a cook's knife and a vegetable chopper, each knife features an exceptionally sharp cutting edge that slices through vegetables and meats with more ease than the thicker cook's knife. Alternating hollows on each side of the blade create air pockets and minimizes the food's ability to stick to the edge, which makes for easier, more efficient slicing. Crafted from a single, seamless piece of the finest stainless-steel alloys, the knives are then hardened and tempered for maximum edge retention, ease of sharpening, and long-lasting durability. They also offer forged solid bolsters and full tangs for enhanced strength. The knives are covered by a limited lifetime warranty and should be washed by hand for best results.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/315HD3SHXNL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sterling Home","source_asin":"B000GIH3HY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-619247","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000GIH3HY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000GIH3HY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":619248,"name":"Millware Manual Coffee Grinder Set with 8 Adjustable Coarseness, Hand Mill Conical Burr for Espresso Beans, French Press, Pour Over, Drip Rustproof, 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kJ4Z-pSsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"?TREAT YOURSELF WITH MILLWARE Grind a cup of delicious coffee by hand, experience the fun of grinding coffee and feel the Aroma to ensures maximum freshness, taste and sipping satisfaction. Its elegant finish makes it a lovely addition to your coffee bar. ?MILLWARE GRINDER DURABILITY Our coffee grinder is enduring easy to maintain with rustproof stainless steel, ceramic burr, glass. ?GRIND YOUR FAVOUTIRE COFFEE Enjoy any kind of your favorite coffee easily, healthy: Espresso, French Press, Pour Over, Drip Coffee, Moka pot, Chemex, Cold brew due to the external coarseness adjustment with 8 grades settings, 15 levels of coarseness. ?POWER/ELECTRICITY SAVING No batteries, no power needed with very easy operation, with an ideal lengthen metal handle and wooden knob make it very easy to grind the coffee beans effortlessly. ?HOW TO USE 1-Remove the hand crank, hooper cover. 2-Fill the coffee bean into the hooper, close the hooper lid. 3-Turn the coarseness settings to your desired grind level. 4-Put back the crank, rotate clockwise with handle. ? MILLWARE GRINDER SET INCLUDES Manual Grinder with hooper capacity of 60gm beans X 1 Glass jars 200ml with lids as a spare or storage for beans or grounded coffee X 2 Measuring spoon capacity of 7gm beans X 1 Cleaning brush X 1 Instruction Manual X 1 ?CLEANING - CARE By using soft damp cloth, wipe the outside of the mill and use the cleaning brush included in the box to clean the inside of the grinder. MILLWARE IS AMAZING, IDEAL PERFECT GIFT Surprise coffee lovers, Family, partners and friends with unforgettable gift packed in a precious Elegant Box. ADD TO YOUR CART, ASK FOR THE GIFT WRAPPING!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kJ4Z-pSsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Millware","source_asin":"B0B8DQ6W57","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-619248","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8DQ6W57","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8DQ6W57","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
