window.products.push({"id":619262,"name":"iDesign Classico Metal Swing Shower Caddy for Tall Shampoo, Conditioner, and Soap with Hooks for Razors, Towels, Loofahs, and More, 9\" x 5.34\" x 20.98","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71w-0+GyI4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Upgrade your bathroom storage with the iDesign Classico Swing Hanging Shower Caddy. This all-in-one organizer features three storage shelves, four hanging hooks, and a towel bar to keep bathroom necessities such as shampoo and conditioner bottles, shower gel, bar soap, toothbrushes, toothpaste, and more within reach in the shower or bathtub. The innovative top shelves swing outward to accommodate taller items, and they can each hold one bottle upside down to help you use every last drop of your hair and body care products. The multi-purpose storage hooks are designed to fit standard-sized razors in addition to washcloths, loofahs, sponges, and brushes. The open wire design provides proper airflow and allows items to dry more efficiently after use, while the non-slip grip and integrated suction cups ensure a secure hold in wet or dry conditions. Simply place the organizer over the top of the shower head and push the suction cups into place on the wall to set up - no mounting or hardware required! The durable steel wire construction with satin silver finish stands up to every day use and is easy to clean with mild soap and water. Measuring 9\" x 5.34\" x 20.98\", this storage caddy adds instant organization in unused space in the shower. With iDesign by InterDesign, you can #LiveSimply every day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71w-0+GyI4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iDesign","source_asin":"B00M0E4D5W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-619262","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00M0E4D5W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00M0E4D5W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":619263,"name":"Mind Reader Meat Chopper Spatula, Heat Resistant Kitchen Tool for Mixing, Cutting, Mashing, Dicing Ground Beef, Avocado, Pack of 2, Nylon, Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.7,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Xjcl9yB7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Smash your way into easier cooking with a Mind Reader Meat Chopper Spatula. Make mince of some of the toughest tasks in cooking using this convenient tool from Mind Reader Products. Ordinary food processors, meat grinders, and similar appliances can be costly and frustrating to use, and even more agitating to clean. Trying to free up minuscule food particles from the sharp blades can be dangerous and stressful, but ordinary spatulas also don’t quite seem to--dare we say, cut it? Eliminate the stress and struggle of making your favorite meals at home with this convenient device. The meat chopper spatula features a streamlined, minimalist design that allows you to whip up your favorite creations with greater ease than expensive, complicated tools. The four-bladed, heat-resistant design utilizes food-safe, non-stick materials to parse through ground meat, potatoes, pork, tuna, avocados, and other ingredients. Dice up tough items like frozen beef without having to bend a flimsy spatula or bust out a complicated food processor. The non-slip grip ensures you’re able to maintain your hold on the masher even when you’re fervently chopping. Create instant homemade guacamole, mashed potatoes, or pasta sauce without stress. When you’re finished, simply wash the whole thing in the sink, or put it in the dishwasher without worrying about sharp edges. Enjoy stress-free chopped meat and other ingredients with the easy-to-use meat masher from Mind Reader Products. Dimensions: 9.65″ L x 3.15″ W x 3.15″ H Materials: Nylon","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Xjcl9yB7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mind Reader","source_asin":"B093F1144R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-619263","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093F1144R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093F1144R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
