window.products.push({"id":619638,"name":"Vicluke Microfiber Technology Cloth Massage Recliner Chair with Heated, 360 Degree Swivel Rocker Recliner Lounge Chair, Leather Reclining Sofa with Si","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":329.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ywmbBh46L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Microfiber Technolog Fabric: Vicluke adapt microfiber technology cloth to make this modern massage recliner. This fabric maintains the touch of genuine leather, but at the same time has the characteristics of easy-to-clean fabric. And the innovative fabric is hard-wearing and scratch-resistant, bringing you maximum comfort even after a long period of use. The extra thickened padded seat and backrest cradle you in comfort and can keep their original shape for years. 360°Swivel Rocking Recliner: Swivel feature means you can easily move the recliner chair 360 degrees in either direction while sitting, which stops you from having to twist and turn in your chair or stand to reposition. Pull out the D-ring handle, you can adjust the recline angle between 120-150 degree to meet your different needs. The footrest can be smooth and easy to close which is more convenient for the elderly or pregnant. Massage & Heating: This swivel recliner has 4 vibrating massage parts(8 points), 5 control modes, and 2 intensity options. You can enjoy a full body massage at your home. Cooperating with heat function on the lumbar part of the recliner sofa, it not only relieves your waist pressure, but also promote blood circulation while massaging. The multiple functions also work to comforts your fatigue and tension and help you fall into a well-deserve sleep. Widely Application: Elegant yet practical, the recliner not only perfectly complements most furniture sets of house decor, but also an ideal choice for business places like pub or cafe restaurant for its sophisticated look. We also add a spacious side pocket for it to store things like magazines, books or remote. Whenever wrapping yourself into the chair, your exhaustion will gradually fade way with time. Easy Assembly & Service: This upholstered recliner comes with two boxes and all parts are included. It can be assembled easily according to the instruction. We provide professional customer service within 24 hour, you can feel free to contact us at any time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ywmbBh46L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vicluke","source_asin":"B09QBYYRKK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-619638","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QBYYRKK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QBYYRKK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":619639,"name":"Melange 6-Piece 100% Melamine Dinner Plate Set (Moroccan Tiles) | Shatter-Proof and Chip-Resistant Melamine Dinner Plates | Color: Multicolor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1ou29SskgL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"\"Experience the Difference of an Authentic Melamine Dinner Set Upgrade your dinnerware set with one that blends superior durability, hassle-free maintenance, and rustic charm. Made using heavy weight melamine, these dinner plate and bowls are virtually unbreakable, keeps chips and cracks at bay, and can actually be cleaned in the dishwasher. Introduce some quirk to your dinner table with a beautiful melamine dinnerware set that doesn’t cut corners. - Heavy duty feel and break-resistant design. - Comes in multiple pack options at a price you’ll love. - Assorted colors - Dishwasher safe and 100% BPA-free. - Great for camping, RVs and outdoor use. Extra Dose of Durability Not all melamine dinner sets are created equal. Most come with a melamine content of between 30-60% that makes them weak, prone to cracks, and easy to shatter. But we’ve taken the premium approach and used higher percentage of melamine to create dinner plates and bowls that beautifully weather the rigors of everyday use Great for Outdoors No need for paper plates. Whether you’re going out camping, having an outdoor soiree, or setting off in your RV or trailer, our melamine plates and bowls complement it all with a touch of durability. Tough and hardy, this dinnerware set introduces a sense of normalcy to outdoor dining without any of the fragility. Maintenance Made Easy Get yourself melamine plates and bowls that you can actually clean in the dishwasher. While others break or crack while placed in there, our fully melamine dinner set can be safely cleaned without chipping the plates or ruining the design. Dine in Style Quirky yet cute, vintage yet modern, this colorful melamine dinnerware infuses any setting with a charm that never quits. The plates and bowls come in multiple colors and design options and are crowned by beautiful asymmetry. About Melange Melange dinnerware is all about treating you to everyday elegance. We believe fine dinner sets shouldn’t mean fragile dinner sets. We believe every meal should be complemented by dinnerware that makes you smile. That’s why we’ve used premium materials to bring on the durability, special craftsmanship to enhance the longevity, and lovely detailing to catch anyone’s eye.\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1ou29SskgL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Melange","source_asin":"B07GNXK951","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-619639","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GNXK951","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GNXK951","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
