window.products.push({"id":619699,"name":"ReynosoHomeDecor Round Pillow Insert Form (24\" Diameter)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.77,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714sQu33eEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These white cotton round insert pillows are handmade and made to order by our shop. They are filled with synthetic down-like polyester fiber designed to give your pillows a soft and sumptuous yet firm feel. They are non-allergenic. Please note that round pillow inserts is are made for round pillow covers that measure the same in diameter; to elaborate, it is sized for round pillow covers that a basically two circles attached together around the circumferece. If you have a round pillow cover with a side (and hence, a height) the correct size of round pillow insert would equal the diameter plus the height. For example, if you have an 18 inch diameter round pillow cover with a height of 3 inches, you would need a 21 inch round pillow insert. If you have any comments, questions, and/or concerns please send us an email before you make a purchase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714sQu33eEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ReynosoHomeDecor","source_asin":"B00F57MT6Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-619699","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00F57MT6Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00F57MT6Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
