window.products.push({"id":619721,"name":"T-fal Excite Manual Juicer System, Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DCEIyUFYL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"The T-fal Excite Juicer includes two cups for single use or service at a table. The smaller cup doubles as a lid, allowing for fridge storage. The juicing insert efficiently filters out seeds and excess pulp. The non-slip base provides stability while in operation. The T-fal Excite Juicer is easy to clean and dishwasher safe. Lifetime Warranty: This product is warrantied against defects in materials and workmanship for life from the date of purchase. If this product fails to conform, a replacement will be provided at no charge.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DCEIyUFYL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bialetti","source_asin":"B00OFLPGBI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-619721","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00OFLPGBI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00OFLPGBI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":619722,"name":"Chesserfeld Faux Fur Throw Pillow, Gray, 20in x 12in, Decorative Accent for Bed, Living Room Couch, or Dorm Room, Soft, Authentic Sheepskin Feel, Boho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71074K2TLCL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"Make a chic style statement — in any room of your home — with this sumptuously soft faux fur throw pillow. Specially crafted to mimic the look and feel of real sheepskin. It's amazing how beautiful couch pillows can instantly and dramatically transform a room. That's why you'll want a Chesserfeld fur pillow for every living space in your home. Available in three gorgeous shades and two styles to fit any design scheme, our faux fur pillow features a select blend of synthetic fibers to replicate genuine sheepskin. It lends rich texture to your décor while making your sofa or loveseat an inviting place to lounge, laugh, and relax. Plus, your Chesserfeld pillow is as practical as it is stunning. It comes with an insert, so no need to buy one separately. You can easily remove the cover, too, whether you want to freshen it up in the washing machine or swap in another pillow cover for a new look. 20\" x 12\" rectangular style Available in three (3) colors Available in 2 styles (square or rectangular) Insert included Removable cover with hidden zipper Feels like genuine sheepskin Durable, for lasting beauty Cruelty free (all man-made materials) Machine washable Kid friendly This posh pillow is the perfect affordable accent for a living room, family room, master bedroom, teen bedroom, or dorm room. Need a home gift for that style-savvy person in your life? Our fur pillow makes a great gift for a housewarming, engagement, or wedding. Click \"Add to Cart\" to buy now. Note: Your Chesserfeld faux fur throw pillow is vacuum-packed for shipping and will be flat when it arrives. All you need to do is carefully cut the packaging and your pillow will spring to plush life almost immediately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71074K2TLCL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chesserfeld","source_asin":"B084GDTQFH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-619722","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084GDTQFH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084GDTQFH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":619723,"name":"INSE Cordless Vacuum Cleaner, 6-in-1 Powerful Stick Vacuum, Rechargeable Vacuum Cleaner with 2200mAh Battery Up to 45 Mins Runtime, Lightweight Handhe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61T0zc-P-+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Powerful Suction, Quickly Cleaning】This INSE cordless vacuum cleaner features high-efficient motor which can produce strong suction and has a good cleaning performance. The vacuum cleaner has adjustable suction power modes. Standard mode is good for dust, pet hair, sesame, etc. and with the max mode it can quickly pick up grain, cat litter, etc from the floor, carpet, sofa, desk, curtain, car, and so on. This stick vacuum can meet your daily cleaning needs and is perfect for a home with pets. 【Long-lasting Life & Fast Charging】2200mAh battery inside the cordless vacuum provides a long-lasting running time to cleaning, 45 mins with the standard mode, and 25 mins with the max mode. And you can switch between the 2 modes with the button at the handle if needed. What's more, the rechargeable vacuum cordless only needs 3-4 hours to be full-charged. It can clean the whole house with one charge, and very convenient for daily and quick cleaning at any time. 【5-Stage Advanced Filtration System】Equipped with 5 high-efficient stages of a complete sealing filtration system, the vacuum cleaner cordless can trap 99.99% of microscopic particles and expel cleaner air. The househeld vacuum cleaner filters the air while cleaning to take full care of your home's cleanliness. (Please Note: The stainless filter is washable and the HEPA filter is not washable. And regular cleaning of the stainless filter will prevent weakening of suction and clogging.) 【Lightweight, Telescoping & Versatile】This lightweight cordless stick vacuum is only 3.3lbs, very suitable for one-hand cleaning, and very good for the elderly and children to use. Plus, it has a telescoping wand that can convert to a handheld vacuum for cleaning the sofa, curtain, and even the car. What's more, it has a very flexible brush head with a LED light on it. Simply turn it on and an angled beam of light shines directly in front of the vacuum, lighting and capturing tiny bits of dust. 【3 Charging Methods and Easy Storage】Comes with a wall mount, this cordless vaccum pet hair can be simply hung on the wall when finishing the cleaning. This battery vacuum cleaner has totally 3 ways to charge, removing the main body to charge, removing the handle to charge, and hanging it on the wall to charge. Easily hidden away in a cupboard, it takes up less room, very convenient to store or use. 【What You Will Get】- INSE vacuum cordless, motorized brush head, retractable metal tube, stiff roller brush, soft roller brush, long crevice, oval brush for fabric surface, 2 replaceable HEPA filters, charging base with mains charger, 2 in 1 cleaner tool for cleaning hair from the roller and HEPA filter, instruction manual, service card and 7/24 INSE customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61T0zc-P-+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"INSE","source_asin":"B0871WQFPQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-619723","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0871WQFPQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0871WQFPQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
